WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.650
- We are back now, Kelly
always closes out the show

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.000
with a story off social media

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.810
that'll leave you with a smile.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:06.643
Here's one of mine.

00:00:06.643 --> 00:00:09.460
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.470
So TikTok is full of musical talent,

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:15.260
but few are as unique or as
popular as the dad from Oklahoma

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.810
who uses a talk box to duet
with his three adopted children.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.820
It's gotten him over
11 million subscribers.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:22.967
Let's take a look.

00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:25.800
(classical music)

00:00:35.717 --> 00:00:36.550
(crowd clapping)

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.060
Let's get that musical miser up in here.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.400
Say hi to Jason.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.677
(crowd cheering)

00:00:40.677 --> 00:00:42.500
Jason are you there?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.000
- Yes, it's so good to be here.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.820
- Now. Now this all started as a way

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:48.717
to bring your family together, right?

00:00:48.717 --> 00:00:50.720
- Yes, indeed.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:53.910
My family, me and my wife
tried to start a family

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:56.000
and we ran into some fertility issues.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.840
So my wife dragged me
kicking and screaming

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:03.130
into the concept of doing
adoption through foster care.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.410
And while we were doing foster care,

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.000
we had 11 children come through our home

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.950
and we adopted three of them.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:12.480
And one of the things
was that I kind of strike

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.515
an imposing figure when I opened the door

00:01:14.515 --> 00:01:16.030
(host laughs) and this kids come through.

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:19.010
And so we used music to kind of,

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:21.290
that was the universal
language for the kids

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.580
that brought us all all together.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:23.810
So I used music.

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:26.670
We sang in the car, we
sang in front of the TV

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.770
and it kind of gave the
kids a place to feel safe,

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.200
a place to feel at home

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.120
- [Host ] Now. And, how did TikTok

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.870
come into the whole picture?

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.550
- Okay. So TikTok started because

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:39.300
as a paraeducator in
special education department

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.620
at the school, and these kids were using

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.840
all these references.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.600
These pop culture references
I had no idea about.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.410
And so I said, where'd
you get this stuff from?

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.250
They said, "Go check it out on TikTok."

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.070
And when I finally found
out that it was an app,

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.130
I went and downloaded it.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:56.370
And I just saw this explosion
of creativity out there

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.040
with all these kids, all these adults

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:00.150
just using it to find their voice.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:01.580
And I thought, Hey

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.130
I can make some content
and see what happens.

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:08.160
And I did not anticipate the
big explosion that we have now

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:10.020
but yeah, because of that

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.450
I was able to connect with
a great community of people

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:15.100
that just love music, love my family

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.660
and just love the story
of how we came together.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.030
And it's just been an
awesome thing for us.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:20.940
- Oh my God.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.562
That's, that's so incredible.

00:02:22.562 --> 00:02:26.910
Jason, I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.000
But that's not all you get
more than just a heart.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.550
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:35.220
the makers of FriXion
the go-to erasable pen

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:37.370
of the Kelly Clarkson Show wanna celebrate

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.450
those creating fearlessly, just like you.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.153
So they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars.

00:02:42.153 --> 00:02:44.903
(crowd cheering)

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.650
- This is so awesome.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:48.483
- My gosh.

00:02:48.483 --> 00:02:51.280
You are as most welcome and
you are the absolute best.

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.180
I mean what an incredible story Jason.

